ify every order line in TRAIN_TRANSFER_B as one of the allowed actions, include transfer requests where internal movement can clear the shortage, identify account-blocked orders, and summarize the wave.\\n\",\"input_files\":{\"payloads/allocation_memo.md\":975,\"payloads/answer_template.json\":3342,\"prompt.txt\":714},\"project_id\":\"gdpevo-group007\",\"revision\":\"56d60ae4ae5e067d1ec0ee1f850622e69f422179\",\"shared_environment_id\":\"gdpevo:56d60ae4ae5e067d1ec0ee1f850622e69f422179:task_group_007:env\",\"source_id\":\"gdpevo:56d60ae4ae5e067d1ec0ee1f850622e69f422179:task_group_007:train_004:input\",\"task_family\":\"northwind_erp\",\"task_id\":\"train_004\"}","evidence_kind":"task","purpose":"regression"}]
